codex
A narrower and sounder repair is available: keep the input as the semantics’ native `ValSeq`, and specialize only the existing `#bindTgt` rule for syntactic `Int` values in plain frames. The specialized rule performs the identical map update as the fixed rule; it merely preserves the refined sort so the next comparison is executable. I’ll prove that exact state transition bridge-free over its full continuation/map context before relying on it.
apply patch
